>P.S.  Elric has a rough time - if you're easily depressed, steer clear of them!

Actually Arioch was a Lord of Chaos. Elric served Chaos throughout the main
part of his life, but in the last book he takes the side of Law to prevent
Chaos's triumph.

Stormbringer and Mournblade are demons trapped in the form of swords; they
are therefore intelligent. When they strike an enemy they drain away its
soul; some of the soul's energy flows to the sword's wielder. Elric, being
an albino, finds this extra source of energy rather useful, though he also
has various potions and concoctions that can also give him strength.
Presumably another portion of this energy is consumed by the sword, and the
rest is sent to Arioch.

Stormbringer's biggest flaw as a weapon was its lust for killing; just about
all of Elric's friends die by it, and Elric himself eventually is killed by
it.

